---
title: How to Deploy TanStack Router to Production
---
NIFT_TANSTACK_DOCUMENT_V1
{"document":{"type":"root","children":[{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"text","value":"This guide covers deploying TanStack Router applications to popular hosting platforms."}]},{"type":"heading","depth":2,"id":"quick-start","children":[{"type":"text","value":"Quick Start"}]},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"text","value":"Single Page Applications (SPAs) need special server configuration to handle client-side routing. Configure your hosting platform to serve "},{"type":"inlineCode","value":"index.html"},{"type":"text","value":" for all routes, allowing TanStack Router to handle navigation."}]},{"type":"thematicBreak"},{"type":"heading","depth":2,"id":"netlify-deployment","children":[{"type":"text","value":"Netlify Deployment"}]},{"type":"heading","depth":3,"id":"1-create-redirects-file","children":[{"type":"text","value":"1. Create "},{"type":"inlineCode","value":"_redirects"},{"type":"text","value":" File"}]},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"text","value":"Create a "},{"type":"inlineCode","value":"public/_redirects"},{"type":"text","value":" file (or "},{"type":"inlineCode","value":"_redirects"},{"type":"text","value":" in your build output):"}]},{"type":"code","value":"/*    /index.html   200"},{"type":"heading","depth":3,"id":"2-alternative-netlify-toml","children":[{"type":"text","value":"2. Alternative: "},{"type":"inlineCode","value":"netlify.toml"}]},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"text","value":"Create a "},{"type":"inlineCode","value":"netlify.toml"},{"type":"text","value":" file in your project root:"}]},{"type":"code","value":"[[redirects]]\n  from = \"/*\"\n  to = \"/index.html\"\n  status = 200\n\n[build]\n  publish = \"dist\"\n  command = \"npm run build\"","lang":"toml"},{"type":"heading","depth":3,"id":"3-for-tanstack-start-ssr","children":[{"type":"text","value":"3. For TanStack Start (SSR)"}]},{"type":"code","value":"[build]\n  publish = \".output/public\"\n  command = \"npm run build\"\n\n[functions]\n  directory = \".output/server\"\n\n[[redirects]]\n  from = \"/api/*\"\n  to = \"/.netlify/functions/server\"\n  status = 200\n\n[[redirects]]\n  from = \"/*\"\n  to = \"/index.html\"\n  status = 200","lang":"toml"},{"type":"thematicBreak"},{"type":"heading","depth":2,"id":"cloudflare-pages","children":[{"type":"text","value":"Cloudflare Pages"}]},{"type":"heading","depth":3,"id":"1-create-redirects-file-2","children":[{"type":"text","value":"1. Create "},{"type":"inlineCode","value":"_redirects"},{"type":"text","value":" File"}]},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"text","value":"Create a "},{"type":"inlineCode","value":"public/_redirects"},{"type":"text","value":" file:"}]},{"type":"code","value":"/*    /index.html   200"},{"type":"heading","depth":3,"id":"2-alternative-routes-json","children":[{"type":"text","value":"2. Alternative: "},{"type":"inlineCode","value":"_routes.json"}]},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"text","value":"Create a "},{"type":"inlineCode","value":"public/_routes.json"},{"type":"text","value":" file for more control:"}]},{"type":"code","value":"{\n  \"version\": 1,\n  \"include\": [\"/*\"],\n  \"exclude\": [\"/api/*\"]\n}","lang":"json"},{"type":"heading","depth":3,"id":"3-for-tanstack-start-ssr-2","children":[{"type":"text","value":"3. For TanStack Start (SSR)"}]},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"text","value":"Create "},{"type":"inlineCode","value":"functions/_middleware.ts"},{"type":"text","value":" for SSR support:"}]},{"type":"code","value":"export const onRequest: PagesFunction = async (context) => {\n  // Handle SSR requests\n  return await handleSSR(context)\n}","lang":"ts"},{"type":"heading","depth":3,"id":"4-deploy-via-git","children":[{"type":"text","value":"4. Deploy via Git"}]},{"type":"list","ordered":true,"start":1,"items":[{"type":"listItem","children":[{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"text","value":"Connect your GitHub repository to Cloudflare Pages"}]}]},{"type":"listItem","children":[{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"text","value":"Set build settings:"}]},{"type":"list","ordered":false,"items":[{"type":"listItem","children":[{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"strong","children":[{"type":"text","value":"Build command:"}]},{"type":"text","value":" "},{"type":"inlineCode","value":"npm run build"}]}]},{"type":"listItem","children":[{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"strong","children":[{"type":"text","value":"Build output directory:"}]},{"type":"text","value":" "},{"type":"inlineCode","value":"dist"}]}]},{"type":"listItem","children":[{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"strong","children":[{"type":"text","value":"Root directory:"}]},{"type":"text","value":" (leave empty)"}]}]}]}]}]},{"type":"heading","depth":3,"id":"5-deploy-via-wrangler-cli","children":[{"type":"text","value":"5. Deploy via Wrangler CLI"}]},{"type":"code","value":"# Install Wrangler\nnpm install -g wrangler\n\n# Deploy\nwrangler pages publish dist --project-name=my-app","lang":"bash"},{"type":"thematicBreak"},{"type":"heading","depth":2,"id":"vercel-deployment","children":[{"type":"text","value":"Vercel Deployment"}]},{"type":"heading","depth":3,"id":"1-create-vercel-json","children":[{"type":"text","value":"1. Create "},{"type":"inlineCode","value":"vercel.json"}]},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"text","value":"Create a "},{"type":"inlineCode","value":"vercel.json"},{"type":"text","value":" file in your project root:"}]},{"type":"code","value":"{\n  \"rewrites\": [\n    {\n      \"source\": \"/(.*)\",\n      \"destination\": \"/index.html\"\n    }\n  ]\n}","lang":"json"},{"type":"heading","depth":3,"id":"2-for-tanstack-start-ssr-applications","children":[{"type":"text","value":"2. For TanStack Start (SSR) Applications"}]},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"text","value":"If using TanStack Start with SSR, use this configuration instead:"}]},{"type":"code","value":"{\n  \"functions\": {\n    \"app/server.ts\": {\n      \"runtime\": \"nodejs18.x\"\n    }\n  },\n  \"routes\": [\n    {\n      \"src\": \"/(.*)\",\n      \"dest\": \"/api/server\"\n    }\n  ]\n}","lang":"json"},{"type":"heading","depth":3,"id":"3-build-configuration","children":[{"type":"text","value":"3. Build Configuration"}]},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"text","value":"Ensure your "},{"type":"inlineCode","value":"package.json"},{"type":"text","value":" has the correct build script:"}]},{"type":"code","value":"{\n  \"scripts\": {\n    \"build\": \"vite build\",\n    \"preview\": \"vite preview\"\n  }\n}","lang":"json"},{"type":"heading","depth":3,"id":"4-deploy","children":[{"type":"text","value":"4. Deploy"}]},{"type":"code","value":"# Install Vercel CLI\nnpm i -g vercel\n\n# Deploy\nvercel","lang":"bash"},{"type":"thematicBreak"},{"type":"heading","depth":2,"id":"github-pages","children":[{"type":"text","value":"GitHub Pages"}]},{"type":"heading","depth":3,"id":"1-create-404-html","children":[{"type":"text","value":"1. Create "},{"type":"inlineCode","value":"404.html"}]},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"text","value":"GitHub Pages requires a "},{"type":"inlineCode","value":"404.html"},{"type":"text","value":" file that duplicates "},{"type":"inlineCode","value":"index.html"},{"type":"text","value":":"}]},{"type":"code","value":"# After building\ncp dist/index.html dist/404.html","lang":"bash"},{"type":"heading","depth":3,"id":"2-update-vite-config-js","children":[{"type":"text","value":"2. Update "},{"type":"inlineCode","value":"vite.config.js"}]},{"type":"code","value":"import { defineConfig } from 'vite'\nimport react from '@vitejs/plugin-react'\nimport { tanstackRouter } from '@tanstack/router-plugin/vite'\n\nexport default defineConfig({\n  base: '/your-repo-name/', // Replace with your repository name\n  plugins: [\n    tanstackRouter({\n      target: 'react',\n      autoCodeSplitting: true,\n    }),\n    react(),\n  ],\n  build: {\n    outDir: 'dist',\n  },\n})","lang":"js"},{"type":"heading","depth":3,"id":"3-github-actions-workflow","children":[{"type":"text","value":"3. GitHub Actions Workflow"}]},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"text","value":"Create "},{"type":"inlineCode","value":".github/workflows/deploy.yml"},{"type":"text","value":":"}]},{"type":"code","value":"name: Deploy to GitHub Pages\n\non:\n  push:\n    branches: [main]\n\njobs:\n  deploy:\n    runs-on: ubuntu-latest\n    steps:\n      - uses: actions/checkout@v3\n\n      - name: Setup Node.js\n        uses: actions/setup-node@v3\n        with:\n          node-version: '18'\n          cache: 'npm'\n\n      - name: Install dependencies\n        run: npm ci\n\n      - name: Build\n        run: npm run build\n\n      - name: Create 404.html\n        run: cp dist/index.html dist/404.html\n\n      - name: Deploy to GitHub Pages\n        uses: peaceiris/actions-gh-pages@v3\n        with:\n          github_token: ${{ secrets.GITHUB_TOKEN }}\n          publish_dir: ./dist","lang":"yaml"},{"type":"thematicBreak"},{"type":"heading","depth":2,"id":"firebase-hosting","children":[{"type":"text","value":"Firebase Hosting"}]},{"type":"heading","depth":3,"id":"1-create-firebase-json","children":[{"type":"text","value":"1. Create "},{"type":"inlineCode","value":"firebase.json"}]},{"type":"code","value":"{\n  \"hosting\": {\n    \"public\": \"dist\",\n    \"ignore\": [\"firebase.json\", \"**/.*\", \"**/node_modules/**\"],\n    \"rewrites\": [\n      {\n        \"source\": \"**\",\n        \"destination\": \"/index.html\"\n      }\n    ]\n  }\n}","lang":"json"},{"type":"heading","depth":3,"id":"2-deploy","children":[{"type":"text","value":"2. Deploy"}]},{"type":"code","value":"# Install Firebase CLI\nnpm install -g firebase-tools\n\n# Login and initialize\nfirebase login\nfirebase init hosting\n\n# Build and deploy\nnpm run build\nfirebase deploy","lang":"bash"},{"type":"thematicBreak"},{"type":"heading","depth":2,"id":"apache-server","children":[{"type":"text","value":"Apache Server"}]},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"text","value":"Create a "},{"type":"inlineCode","value":".htaccess"},{"type":"text","value":" file in your build output directory:"}]},{"type":"code","value":"<IfModule mod_rewrite.c>\n  RewriteEngine On\n  RewriteBase /\n  RewriteRule ^index\\.html$ - [L]\n  RewriteCond %{REQUEST_FILENAME} !-f\n  RewriteCond %{REQUEST_FILENAME} !-d\n  RewriteRule . /index.html [L]\n</IfModule>","lang":"apache"},{"type":"thematicBreak"},{"type":"heading","depth":2,"id":"nginx","children":[{"type":"text","value":"Nginx"}]},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"text","value":"Add this configuration to your Nginx server block:"}]},{"type":"code","value":"server {\n  listen 80;\n  server_name your-domain.com;\n  root /path/to/your/dist;\n  index index.html;\n\n  location / {\n    try_files $uri $uri/ /index.html;\n  }\n\n  # Optional: Cache static assets\n  location ~* \\.(js|css|png|jpg|jpeg|gif|ico|svg)$ {\n    expires 1y;\n    add_header Cache-Control \"public, immutable\";\n  }\n}","lang":"nginx"},{"type":"thematicBreak"},{"type":"heading","depth":2,"id":"docker-deployment","children":[{"type":"text","value":"Docker Deployment"}]},{"type":"heading","depth":3,"id":"1-create-dockerfile","children":[{"type":"text","value":"1. Create "},{"type":"inlineCode","value":"Dockerfile"}]},{"type":"code","value":"# Build stage\nFROM node:18-alpine AS build\nWORKDIR /app\nCOPY package*.json ./\nRUN npm ci\nCOPY . .\nRUN npm run build\n\n# Production stage\nFROM nginx:alpine\nCOPY --from=build /app/dist /usr/share/nginx/html\nCOPY nginx.conf /etc/nginx/conf.d/default.conf\nEXPOSE 80\nCMD [\"nginx\", \"-g\", \"daemon off;\"]","lang":"dockerfile"},{"type":"heading","depth":3,"id":"2-create-nginx-conf","children":[{"type":"text","value":"2. Create "},{"type":"inlineCode","value":"nginx.conf"}]},{"type":"code","value":"server {\n    listen 80;\n    server_name localhost;\n    root /usr/share/nginx/html;\n    index index.html;\n\n    location / {\n        try_files $uri $uri/ /index.html;\n    }\n}","lang":"nginx"},{"type":"heading","depth":3,"id":"3-build-and-run","children":[{"type":"text","value":"3. Build and Run"}]},{"type":"code","value":"docker build -t my-tanstack-app .\ndocker run -p 80:80 my-tanstack-app","lang":"bash"},{"type":"thematicBreak"},{"type":"heading","depth":2,"id":"production-checklist","children":[{"type":"text","value":"Production Checklist"}]},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"text","value":"Before deploying, ensure you have:"}]},{"type":"list","ordered":false,"items":[{"type":"listItem","children":[{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"text","value":"Created hosting platform configuration file"}]}],"checked":false},{"type":"listItem","children":[{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"text","value":"Set correct base path if deploying to subdirectory"}]}],"checked":false},{"type":"listItem","children":[{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"text","value":"Configured environment variables with "},{"type":"inlineCode","value":"VITE_"},{"type":"text","value":" prefix"}]}],"checked":false},{"type":"listItem","children":[{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"text","value":"Tested all routes by direct URL access"}]}],"checked":false},{"type":"listItem","children":[{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"text","value":"Verified static assets load correctly"}]}],"checked":false}]},{"type":"thematicBreak"},{"type":"heading","depth":2,"id":"common-problems","children":[{"type":"text","value":"Common Problems"}]},{"type":"heading","depth":3,"id":"404-errors-on-page-refresh","children":[{"type":"text","value":"404 Errors on Page Refresh"}]},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"strong","children":[{"type":"text","value":"Problem:"}]},{"type":"text","value":" Routes work when navigating within the app, but refreshing the page shows 404."}]},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"strong","children":[{"type":"text","value":"Cause:"}]},{"type":"text","value":" The server looks for files like "},{"type":"inlineCode","value":"/about/index.html"},{"type":"text","value":" which don't exist in SPAs."}]},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"strong","children":[{"type":"text","value":"Solution:"}]},{"type":"text","value":" Add the configuration files shown above for your hosting platform."}]},{"type":"heading","depth":3,"id":"app-works-locally-but-breaks-when-deployed","children":[{"type":"text","value":"App Works Locally But Breaks When Deployed"}]},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"strong","children":[{"type":"text","value":"Problem:"}]},{"type":"text","value":" App works in development but shows errors in production."}]},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"strong","children":[{"type":"text","value":"Solutions:"}]}]},{"type":"list","ordered":false,"items":[{"type":"listItem","children":[{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"strong","children":[{"type":"text","value":"Subdirectory deployment:"}]},{"type":"text","value":" Configure base path in "},{"type":"inlineCode","value":"vite.config.js"},{"type":"text","value":":"}]},{"type":"code","value":"export default defineConfig({\n  base: '/my-app/', // Match your deployment path\n})","lang":"js"}]},{"type":"listItem","children":[{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"strong","children":[{"type":"text","value":"Build output mismatch:"}]},{"type":"text","value":" Ensure build directory matches hosting config:"}]},{"type":"code","value":"export default defineConfig({\n  build: {\n    outDir: 'dist', // Must match hosting platform setting\n  },\n})","lang":"js"}]},{"type":"listItem","children":[{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"strong","children":[{"type":"text","value":"Environment variables:"}]},{"type":"text","value":" Prefix with "},{"type":"inlineCode","value":"VITE_"},{"type":"text","value":" and rebuild:"}]},{"type":"code","value":"# .env\nVITE_API_URL=https://api.example.com","lang":"bash"}]}]},{"type":"heading","depth":3,"id":"assets-not-loading-css-js-404s","children":[{"type":"text","value":"Assets Not Loading (CSS/JS 404s)"}]},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"strong","children":[{"type":"text","value":"Problem:"}]},{"type":"text","value":" App loads but styling is broken or JavaScript fails to load."}]},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"strong","children":[{"type":"text","value":"Solutions:"}]}]},{"type":"list","ordered":false,"items":[{"type":"listItem","children":[{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"text","value":"Check build output directory in hosting configuration"}]}]},{"type":"listItem","children":[{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"text","value":"Verify public path configuration in Vite"}]}]},{"type":"listItem","children":[{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"text","value":"Ensure static file serving is properly configured"}]}]}]},{"type":"thematicBreak"},{"type":"heading","depth":2,"id":"common-next-steps","children":[{"type":"text","value":"Common Next Steps"}]},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"text","value":"After deployment, you might want to:"}]},{"type":"list","ordered":false,"items":[{"type":"listItem","children":[{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"link","href":"./setup-authentication.md","children":[{"type":"text","value":"How to Set Up Basic Authentication"}]},{"type":"text","value":" - Secure your application with auth"}]}]},{"type":"listItem","children":[{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"link","href":"./migrate-from-react-router.md","children":[{"type":"text","value":"Migrate from React Router v7"}]},{"type":"text","value":" - Complete migration guide if you're coming from React Router"}]}]},{"type":"listItem","children":[{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"link","href":"./setup-ssr.md","children":[{"type":"text","value":"How to Set Up Server-Side Rendering (SSR)"}]}]}]}]},{"type":"html","value":"<!-- TODO: Uncomment as how-to guides are created\n- [How to Optimize Performance](./optimize-performance.md)\n- [How to Set Up Analytics](./setup-analytics.md)\n-->"},{"type":"heading","depth":2,"id":"related-resources","children":[{"type":"text","value":"Related Resources"}]},{"type":"list","ordered":false,"items":[{"type":"listItem","children":[{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"link","href":"https://github.com/TanStack/router/tree/main/examples","children":[{"type":"text","value":"Deployment Examples"}]},{"type":"text","value":" - Official examples"}]}]}]}],"headings":[{"id":"quick-start","text":"Quick Start","level":2},{"id":"netlify-deployment","text":"Netlify Deployment","level":2},{"id":"1-create-redirects-file","text":"1. Create _redirects File","level":3},{"id":"2-alternative-netlify-toml","text":"2. Alternative: netlify.toml","level":3},{"id":"3-for-tanstack-start-ssr","text":"3. For TanStack Start (SSR)","level":3},{"id":"cloudflare-pages","text":"Cloudflare Pages","level":2},{"id":"1-create-redirects-file-2","text":"1. Create _redirects File","level":3},{"id":"2-alternative-routes-json","text":"2. Alternative: _routes.json","level":3},{"id":"3-for-tanstack-start-ssr-2","text":"3. For TanStack Start (SSR)","level":3},{"id":"4-deploy-via-git","text":"4. Deploy via Git","level":3},{"id":"5-deploy-via-wrangler-cli","text":"5. Deploy via Wrangler CLI","level":3},{"id":"vercel-deployment","text":"Vercel Deployment","level":2},{"id":"1-create-vercel-json","text":"1. Create vercel.json","level":3},{"id":"2-for-tanstack-start-ssr-applications","text":"2. For TanStack Start (SSR) Applications","level":3},{"id":"3-build-configuration","text":"3. Build Configuration","level":3},{"id":"4-deploy","text":"4. Deploy","level":3},{"id":"github-pages","text":"GitHub Pages","level":2},{"id":"1-create-404-html","text":"1. Create 404.html","level":3},{"id":"2-update-vite-config-js","text":"2. Update vite.config.js","level":3},{"id":"3-github-actions-workflow","text":"3. GitHub Actions Workflow","level":3},{"id":"firebase-hosting","text":"Firebase Hosting","level":2},{"id":"1-create-firebase-json","text":"1. Create firebase.json","level":3},{"id":"2-deploy","text":"2. Deploy","level":3},{"id":"apache-server","text":"Apache Server","level":2},{"id":"nginx","text":"Nginx","level":2},{"id":"docker-deployment","text":"Docker Deployment","level":2},{"id":"1-create-dockerfile","text":"1. Create Dockerfile","level":3},{"id":"2-create-nginx-conf","text":"2. Create nginx.conf","level":3},{"id":"3-build-and-run","text":"3. Build and Run","level":3},{"id":"production-checklist","text":"Production Checklist","level":2},{"id":"common-problems","text":"Common Problems","level":2},{"id":"404-errors-on-page-refresh","text":"404 Errors on Page Refresh","level":3},{"id":"app-works-locally-but-breaks-when-deployed","text":"App Works Locally But Breaks When Deployed","level":3},{"id":"assets-not-loading-css-js-404s","text":"Assets Not Loading (CSS/JS 404s)","level":3},{"id":"common-next-steps","text":"Common Next Steps","level":2},{"id":"related-resources","text":"Related Resources","level":2}]},"frameworks":[],"downloadMarkdown":"\nThis guide covers deploying TanStack Router applications to popular hosting platforms.\n\n## Quick Start\n\nSingle Page Applications (SPAs) need special server configuration to handle client-side routing. Configure your hosting platform to serve `index.html` for all routes, allowing TanStack Router to handle navigation.\n\n---\n\n## Netlify Deployment\n\n### 1. Create `_redirects` File\n\nCreate a `public/_redirects` file (or `_redirects` in your build output):\n\n```\n/*    /index.html   200\n```\n\n### 2. Alternative: `netlify.toml`\n\nCreate a `netlify.toml` file in your project root:\n\n```toml\n[[redirects]]\n  from = \"/*\"\n  to = \"/index.html\"\n  status = 200\n\n[build]\n  publish = \"dist\"\n  command = \"npm run build\"\n```\n\n### 3. For TanStack Start (SSR)\n\n```toml\n[build]\n  publish = \".output/public\"\n  command = \"npm run build\"\n\n[functions]\n  directory = \".output/server\"\n\n[[redirects]]\n  from = \"/api/*\"\n  to = \"/.netlify/functions/server\"\n  status = 200\n\n[[redirects]]\n  from = \"/*\"\n  to = \"/index.html\"\n  status = 200\n```\n\n---\n\n## Cloudflare Pages\n\n### 1. Create `_redirects` File\n\nCreate a `public/_redirects` file:\n\n```\n/*    /index.html   200\n```\n\n### 2. Alternative: `_routes.json`\n\nCreate a `public/_routes.json` file for more control:\n\n```json\n{\n  \"version\": 1,\n  \"include\": [\"/*\"],\n  \"exclude\": [\"/api/*\"]\n}\n```\n\n### 3. For TanStack Start (SSR)\n\nCreate `functions/_middleware.ts` for SSR support:\n\n```ts\nexport const onRequest: PagesFunction = async (context) => {\n  // Handle SSR requests\n  return await handleSSR(context)\n}\n```\n\n### 4. Deploy via Git\n\n1. Connect your GitHub repository to Cloudflare Pages\n2. Set build settings:\n   - **Build command:** `npm run build`\n   - **Build output directory:** `dist`\n   - **Root directory:** (leave empty)\n\n### 5. Deploy via Wrangler CLI\n\n```bash\n# Install Wrangler\nnpm install -g wrangler\n\n# Deploy\nwrangler pages publish dist --project-name=my-app\n```\n\n---\n\n## Vercel Deployment\n\n### 1. Create `vercel.json`\n\nCreate a `vercel.json` file in your project root:\n\n```json\n{\n  \"rewrites\": [\n    {\n      \"source\": \"/(.*)\",\n      \"destination\": \"/index.html\"\n    }\n  ]\n}\n```\n\n### 2. For TanStack Start (SSR) Applications\n\nIf using TanStack Start with SSR, use this configuration instead:\n\n```json\n{\n  \"functions\": {\n    \"app/server.ts\": {\n      \"runtime\": \"nodejs18.x\"\n    }\n  },\n  \"routes\": [\n    {\n      \"src\": \"/(.*)\",\n      \"dest\": \"/api/server\"\n    }\n  ]\n}\n```\n\n### 3. Build Configuration\n\nEnsure your `package.json` has the correct build script:\n\n```json\n{\n  \"scripts\": {\n    \"build\": \"vite build\",\n    \"preview\": \"vite preview\"\n  }\n}\n```\n\n### 4. Deploy\n\n```bash\n# Install Vercel CLI\nnpm i -g vercel\n\n# Deploy\nvercel\n```\n\n---\n\n## GitHub Pages\n\n### 1. Create `404.html`\n\nGitHub Pages requires a `404.html` file that duplicates `index.html`:\n\n```bash\n# After building\ncp dist/index.html dist/404.html\n```\n\n### 2. Update `vite.config.js`\n\n```js\nimport { defineConfig } from 'vite'\nimport react from '@vitejs/plugin-react'\nimport { tanstackRouter } from '@tanstack/router-plugin/vite'\n\nexport default defineConfig({\n  base: '/your-repo-name/', // Replace with your repository name\n  plugins: [\n    tanstackRouter({\n      target: 'react',\n      autoCodeSplitting: true,\n    }),\n    react(),\n  ],\n  build: {\n    outDir: 'dist',\n  },\n})\n```\n\n### 3. GitHub Actions Workflow\n\nCreate `.github/workflows/deploy.yml`:\n\n```yaml\nname: Deploy to GitHub Pages\n\non:\n  push:\n    branches: [main]\n\njobs:\n  deploy:\n    runs-on: ubuntu-latest\n    steps:\n      - uses: actions/checkout@v3\n\n      - name: Setup Node.js\n        uses: actions/setup-node@v3\n        with:\n          node-version: '18'\n          cache: 'npm'\n\n      - name: Install dependencies\n        run: npm ci\n\n      - name: Build\n        run: npm run build\n\n      - name: Create 404.html\n        run: cp dist/index.html dist/404.html\n\n      - name: Deploy to GitHub Pages\n        uses: peaceiris/actions-gh-pages@v3\n        with:\n          github_token: ${{ secrets.GITHUB_TOKEN }}\n          publish_dir: ./dist\n```\n\n---\n\n## Firebase Hosting\n\n### 1. Create `firebase.json`\n\n```json\n{\n  \"hosting\": {\n    \"public\": \"dist\",\n    \"ignore\": [\"firebase.json\", \"**/.*\", \"**/node_modules/**\"],\n    \"rewrites\": [\n      {\n        \"source\": \"**\",\n        \"destination\": \"/index.html\"\n      }\n    ]\n  }\n}\n```\n\n### 2. Deploy\n\n```bash\n# Install Firebase CLI\nnpm install -g firebase-tools\n\n# Login and initialize\nfirebase login\nfirebase init hosting\n\n# Build and deploy\nnpm run build\nfirebase deploy\n```\n\n---\n\n## Apache Server\n\nCreate a `.htaccess` file in your build output directory:\n\n```apache\n<IfModule mod_rewrite.c>\n  RewriteEngine On\n  RewriteBase /\n  RewriteRule ^index\\.html$ - [L]\n  RewriteCond %{REQUEST_FILENAME} !-f\n  RewriteCond %{REQUEST_FILENAME} !-d\n  RewriteRule . /index.html [L]\n</IfModule>\n```\n\n---\n\n## Nginx\n\nAdd this configuration to your Nginx server block:\n\n```nginx\nserver {\n  listen 80;\n  server_name your-domain.com;\n  root /path/to/your/dist;\n  index index.html;\n\n  location / {\n    try_files $uri $uri/ /index.html;\n  }\n\n  # Optional: Cache static assets\n  location ~* \\.(js|css|png|jpg|jpeg|gif|ico|svg)$ {\n    expires 1y;\n    add_header Cache-Control \"public, immutable\";\n  }\n}\n```\n\n---\n\n## Docker Deployment\n\n### 1. Create `Dockerfile`\n\n```dockerfile\n# Build stage\nFROM node:18-alpine AS build\nWORKDIR /app\nCOPY package*.json ./\nRUN npm ci\nCOPY . .\nRUN npm run build\n\n# Production stage\nFROM nginx:alpine\nCOPY --from=build /app/dist /usr/share/nginx/html\nCOPY nginx.conf /etc/nginx/conf.d/default.conf\nEXPOSE 80\nCMD [\"nginx\", \"-g\", \"daemon off;\"]\n```\n\n### 2. Create `nginx.conf`\n\n```nginx\nserver {\n    listen 80;\n    server_name localhost;\n    root /usr/share/nginx/html;\n    index index.html;\n\n    location / {\n        try_files $uri $uri/ /index.html;\n    }\n}\n```\n\n### 3. Build and Run\n\n```bash\ndocker build -t my-tanstack-app .\ndocker run -p 80:80 my-tanstack-app\n```\n\n---\n\n## Production Checklist\n\nBefore deploying, ensure you have:\n\n- [ ] Created hosting platform configuration file\n- [ ] Set correct base path if deploying to subdirectory\n- [ ] Configured environment variables with `VITE_` prefix\n- [ ] Tested all routes by direct URL access\n- [ ] Verified static assets load correctly\n\n---\n\n## Common Problems\n\n### 404 Errors on Page Refresh\n\n**Problem:** Routes work when navigating within the app, but refreshing the page shows 404.\n\n**Cause:** The server looks for files like `/about/index.html` which don't exist in SPAs.\n\n**Solution:** Add the configuration files shown above for your hosting platform.\n\n### App Works Locally But Breaks When Deployed\n\n**Problem:** App works in development but shows errors in production.\n\n**Solutions:**\n\n- **Subdirectory deployment:** Configure base path in `vite.config.js`:\n  ```js\n  export default defineConfig({\n    base: '/my-app/', // Match your deployment path\n  })\n  ```\n- **Build output mismatch:** Ensure build directory matches hosting config:\n  ```js\n  export default defineConfig({\n    build: {\n      outDir: 'dist', // Must match hosting platform setting\n    },\n  })\n  ```\n- **Environment variables:** Prefix with `VITE_` and rebuild:\n  ```bash\n  # .env\n  VITE_API_URL=https://api.example.com\n  ```\n\n### Assets Not Loading (CSS/JS 404s)\n\n**Problem:** App loads but styling is broken or JavaScript fails to load.\n\n**Solutions:**\n\n- Check build output directory in hosting configuration\n- Verify public path configuration in Vite\n- Ensure static file serving is properly configured\n\n---\n\n## Common Next Steps\n\nAfter deployment, you might want to:\n\n- [How to Set Up Basic Authentication](./setup-authentication.md) - Secure your application with auth\n- [Migrate from React Router v7](./migrate-from-react-router.md) - Complete migration guide if you're coming from React Router\n- [How to Set Up Server-Side Rendering (SSR)](./setup-ssr.md)\n\n<!-- TODO: Uncomment as how-to guides are created\n- [How to Optimize Performance](./optimize-performance.md)\n- [How to Set Up Analytics](./setup-analytics.md)\n-->\n\n## Related Resources\n\n- [Deployment Examples](https://github.com/TanStack/router/tree/main/examples) - Official examples\n","originalRawMarkdown":"---\ntitle: How to Deploy TanStack Router to Production\n---\n\nThis guide covers deploying TanStack Router applications to popular hosting platforms.\n\n## Quick Start\n\nSingle Page Applications (SPAs) need special server configuration to handle client-side routing. Configure your hosting platform to serve `index.html` for all routes, allowing TanStack Router to handle navigation.\n\n---\n\n## Netlify Deployment\n\n### 1. Create `_redirects` File\n\nCreate a `public/_redirects` file (or `_redirects` in your build output):\n\n```\n/*    /index.html   200\n```\n\n### 2. Alternative: `netlify.toml`\n\nCreate a `netlify.toml` file in your project root:\n\n```toml\n[[redirects]]\n  from = \"/*\"\n  to = \"/index.html\"\n  status = 200\n\n[build]\n  publish = \"dist\"\n  command = \"npm run build\"\n```\n\n### 3. For TanStack Start (SSR)\n\n```toml\n[build]\n  publish = \".output/public\"\n  command = \"npm run build\"\n\n[functions]\n  directory = \".output/server\"\n\n[[redirects]]\n  from = \"/api/*\"\n  to = \"/.netlify/functions/server\"\n  status = 200\n\n[[redirects]]\n  from = \"/*\"\n  to = \"/index.html\"\n  status = 200\n```\n\n---\n\n## Cloudflare Pages\n\n### 1. Create `_redirects` File\n\nCreate a `public/_redirects` file:\n\n```\n/*    /index.html   200\n```\n\n### 2. Alternative: `_routes.json`\n\nCreate a `public/_routes.json` file for more control:\n\n```json\n{\n  \"version\": 1,\n  \"include\": [\"/*\"],\n  \"exclude\": [\"/api/*\"]\n}\n```\n\n### 3. For TanStack Start (SSR)\n\nCreate `functions/_middleware.ts` for SSR support:\n\n```ts\nexport const onRequest: PagesFunction = async (context) => {\n  // Handle SSR requests\n  return await handleSSR(context)\n}\n```\n\n### 4. Deploy via Git\n\n1. Connect your GitHub repository to Cloudflare Pages\n2. Set build settings:\n   - **Build command:** `npm run build`\n   - **Build output directory:** `dist`\n   - **Root directory:** (leave empty)\n\n### 5. Deploy via Wrangler CLI\n\n```bash\n# Install Wrangler\nnpm install -g wrangler\n\n# Deploy\nwrangler pages publish dist --project-name=my-app\n```\n\n---\n\n## Vercel Deployment\n\n### 1. Create `vercel.json`\n\nCreate a `vercel.json` file in your project root:\n\n```json\n{\n  \"rewrites\": [\n    {\n      \"source\": \"/(.*)\",\n      \"destination\": \"/index.html\"\n    }\n  ]\n}\n```\n\n### 2. For TanStack Start (SSR) Applications\n\nIf using TanStack Start with SSR, use this configuration instead:\n\n```json\n{\n  \"functions\": {\n    \"app/server.ts\": {\n      \"runtime\": \"nodejs18.x\"\n    }\n  },\n  \"routes\": [\n    {\n      \"src\": \"/(.*)\",\n      \"dest\": \"/api/server\"\n    }\n  ]\n}\n```\n\n### 3. Build Configuration\n\nEnsure your `package.json` has the correct build script:\n\n```json\n{\n  \"scripts\": {\n    \"build\": \"vite build\",\n    \"preview\": \"vite preview\"\n  }\n}\n```\n\n### 4. Deploy\n\n```bash\n# Install Vercel CLI\nnpm i -g vercel\n\n# Deploy\nvercel\n```\n\n---\n\n## GitHub Pages\n\n### 1. Create `404.html`\n\nGitHub Pages requires a `404.html` file that duplicates `index.html`:\n\n```bash\n# After building\ncp dist/index.html dist/404.html\n```\n\n### 2. Update `vite.config.js`\n\n```js\nimport { defineConfig } from 'vite'\nimport react from '@vitejs/plugin-react'\nimport { tanstackRouter } from '@tanstack/router-plugin/vite'\n\nexport default defineConfig({\n  base: '/your-repo-name/', // Replace with your repository name\n  plugins: [\n    tanstackRouter({\n      target: 'react',\n      autoCodeSplitting: true,\n    }),\n    react(),\n  ],\n  build: {\n    outDir: 'dist',\n  },\n})\n```\n\n### 3. GitHub Actions Workflow\n\nCreate `.github/workflows/deploy.yml`:\n\n```yaml\nname: Deploy to GitHub Pages\n\non:\n  push:\n    branches: [main]\n\njobs:\n  deploy:\n    runs-on: ubuntu-latest\n    steps:\n      - uses: actions/checkout@v3\n\n      - name: Setup Node.js\n        uses: actions/setup-node@v3\n        with:\n          node-version: '18'\n          cache: 'npm'\n\n      - name: Install dependencies\n        run: npm ci\n\n      - name: Build\n        run: npm run build\n\n      - name: Create 404.html\n        run: cp dist/index.html dist/404.html\n\n      - name: Deploy to GitHub Pages\n        uses: peaceiris/actions-gh-pages@v3\n        with:\n          github_token: ${{ secrets.GITHUB_TOKEN }}\n          publish_dir: ./dist\n```\n\n---\n\n## Firebase Hosting\n\n### 1. Create `firebase.json`\n\n```json\n{\n  \"hosting\": {\n    \"public\": \"dist\",\n    \"ignore\": [\"firebase.json\", \"**/.*\", \"**/node_modules/**\"],\n    \"rewrites\": [\n      {\n        \"source\": \"**\",\n        \"destination\": \"/index.html\"\n      }\n    ]\n  }\n}\n```\n\n### 2. Deploy\n\n```bash\n# Install Firebase CLI\nnpm install -g firebase-tools\n\n# Login and initialize\nfirebase login\nfirebase init hosting\n\n# Build and deploy\nnpm run build\nfirebase deploy\n```\n\n---\n\n## Apache Server\n\nCreate a `.htaccess` file in your build output directory:\n\n```apache\n<IfModule mod_rewrite.c>\n  RewriteEngine On\n  RewriteBase /\n  RewriteRule ^index\\.html$ - [L]\n  RewriteCond %{REQUEST_FILENAME} !-f\n  RewriteCond %{REQUEST_FILENAME} !-d\n  RewriteRule . /index.html [L]\n</IfModule>\n```\n\n---\n\n## Nginx\n\nAdd this configuration to your Nginx server block:\n\n```nginx\nserver {\n  listen 80;\n  server_name your-domain.com;\n  root /path/to/your/dist;\n  index index.html;\n\n  location / {\n    try_files $uri $uri/ /index.html;\n  }\n\n  # Optional: Cache static assets\n  location ~* \\.(js|css|png|jpg|jpeg|gif|ico|svg)$ {\n    expires 1y;\n    add_header Cache-Control \"public, immutable\";\n  }\n}\n```\n\n---\n\n## Docker Deployment\n\n### 1. Create `Dockerfile`\n\n```dockerfile\n# Build stage\nFROM node:18-alpine AS build\nWORKDIR /app\nCOPY package*.json ./\nRUN npm ci\nCOPY . .\nRUN npm run build\n\n# Production stage\nFROM nginx:alpine\nCOPY --from=build /app/dist /usr/share/nginx/html\nCOPY nginx.conf /etc/nginx/conf.d/default.conf\nEXPOSE 80\nCMD [\"nginx\", \"-g\", \"daemon off;\"]\n```\n\n### 2. Create `nginx.conf`\n\n```nginx\nserver {\n    listen 80;\n    server_name localhost;\n    root /usr/share/nginx/html;\n    index index.html;\n\n    location / {\n        try_files $uri $uri/ /index.html;\n    }\n}\n```\n\n### 3. Build and Run\n\n```bash\ndocker build -t my-tanstack-app .\ndocker run -p 80:80 my-tanstack-app\n```\n\n---\n\n## Production Checklist\n\nBefore deploying, ensure you have:\n\n- [ ] Created hosting platform configuration file\n- [ ] Set correct base path if deploying to subdirectory\n- [ ] Configured environment variables with `VITE_` prefix\n- [ ] Tested all routes by direct URL access\n- [ ] Verified static assets load correctly\n\n---\n\n## Common Problems\n\n### 404 Errors on Page Refresh\n\n**Problem:** Routes work when navigating within the app, but refreshing the page shows 404.\n\n**Cause:** The server looks for files like `/about/index.html` which don't exist in SPAs.\n\n**Solution:** Add the configuration files shown above for your hosting platform.\n\n### App Works Locally But Breaks When Deployed\n\n**Problem:** App works in development but shows errors in production.\n\n**Solutions:**\n\n- **Subdirectory deployment:** Configure base path in `vite.config.js`:\n  ```js\n  export default defineConfig({\n    base: '/my-app/', // Match your deployment path\n  })\n  ```\n- **Build output mismatch:** Ensure build directory matches hosting config:\n  ```js\n  export default defineConfig({\n    build: {\n      outDir: 'dist', // Must match hosting platform setting\n    },\n  })\n  ```\n- **Environment variables:** Prefix with `VITE_` and rebuild:\n  ```bash\n  # .env\n  VITE_API_URL=https://api.example.com\n  ```\n\n### Assets Not Loading (CSS/JS 404s)\n\n**Problem:** App loads but styling is broken or JavaScript fails to load.\n\n**Solutions:**\n\n- Check build output directory in hosting configuration\n- Verify public path configuration in Vite\n- Ensure static file serving is properly configured\n\n---\n\n## Common Next Steps\n\nAfter deployment, you might want to:\n\n- [How to Set Up Basic Authentication](./setup-authentication.md) - Secure your application with auth\n- [Migrate from React Router v7](./migrate-from-react-router.md) - Complete migration guide if you're coming from React Router\n- [How to Set Up Server-Side Rendering (SSR)](./setup-ssr.md)\n\n<!-- TODO: Uncomment as how-to guides are created\n- [How to Optimize Performance](./optimize-performance.md)\n- [How to Set Up Analytics](./setup-analytics.md)\n-->\n\n## Related Resources\n\n- [Deployment Examples](https://github.com/TanStack/router/tree/main/examples) - Official examples\n"}
